  "osc-pendulum-restoring-force": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-md rounded-xl border bg-indigo-50/40 p-4 dark:bg-indigo-950/20\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 280\" class=\"w-full\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A simple pendulum displaced by an angle theta. The weight mg of the bob is resolved into mg cosine theta along the string and mg sine theta along the arc, the restoring force toward the mean position.\"><defs><marker id=\"osc-pf-arrow\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z\" class=\"fill-rose-600 dark:fill-rose-400\"></path></marker><marker id=\"osc-pf-arrow2\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z\" class=\"fill-slate-500 dark:fill-slate-400\"></path></marker></defs><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"30\" class=\"stroke-slate-600 dark:stroke-slate-300\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3\" class=\"fill-slate-600 dark:fill-slate-300\"></circle><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"180\" class=\"stroke-slate-300 dark:stroke-slate-700\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"></line><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"336.1909890123868\" y2=\"169.07757818501813\" class=\"stroke-indigo-600 dark:stroke-indigo-400\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line><path d=\"M 280 68 A 38 38 0 0 0 294.23505054980467 65.23298647353792\" fill=\"none\" class=\"stroke-slate-500\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path><text x=\"296\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"fill-slate-700 dark:fill-slate-300\">θ</text><circle cx=\"336.1909890123868\" cy=\"169.07757818501813\" r=\"11\" class=\"fill-indigo-500 dark:fill-indigo-400\"></circle><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"180\" r=\"3\" class=\"fill-slate-400\"></circle><text x=\"272\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" class=\"fill-slate-500\">mean</text><line x1=\"336.1909890123868\" y1=\"169.07757818501813\" x2=\"336.1909890123868\" y2=\"239.07757818501813\" class=\"stroke-slate-500\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#osc-pf-arrow2)\"></line><text x=\"342.1909890123868\" y=\"239.07757818501813\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" class=\"fill-slate-700 dark:fill-slate-300\">mg</text><line x1=\"336.1909890123868\" y1=\"169.07757818501813\" x2=\"360.50403197845174\" y2=\"229.25447119687092\" class=\"stroke-slate-400\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" marker-end=\"url(#osc-pf-arrow2)\"></line><text x=\"368.50403197845174\" y=\"241.25447119687092\" font-size=\"11\" class=\"fill-slate-600 dark:fill-slate-400\">mg cosθ</text><line x1=\"336.1909890123868\" y1=\"169.07757818501813\" x2=\"297.29012026668295\" y2=\"184.79454936605367\" class=\"stroke-rose-600 dark:stroke-rose-400\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" marker-end=\"url(#osc-pf-arrow)\"></line><text x=\"241.29012026668295\" y=\"188.79454936605367\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"fill-rose-700 dark:fill-rose-300\">mg sinθ</text></svg><p class=\"mt-2 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground\">The restoring force is mg sinθ, directed along the arc back to the mean position. For small θ, sinθ ≈ θ, so the force is proportional to displacement — the simple-harmonic condition behind T = 2π√(L/g).</p></div>",
